---
title: "Sequence: live price quote (price calendar and booking box)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Customer
    participant B as Browser (price-calendar.js)
    participant A as api/price-quote.php
    participant R as rate_limit.php
    participant P as pricing.php
    participant DB as MySQL
    U->>B: pick pickup and return days on the calendar
    B->>A: GET api/price-quote.php?car=7&from=...&to=...
    A->>A: api_require_get() (else 405)
    A->>R: api_rate_limit('api_quote', 120 per 15 min)
    alt over the limit
        A-->>B: 429 + Retry-After
    end
    A->>A: api_car(), dates valid, from >= today, <= 90 days, not driver-only
    A->>P: public_quote(car, from, to)
    P->>DB: tbl_price_forecast rows for the car and dates
    P->>P: sum day prices, merge reasons, fall back to base price beyond the forecast
    P->>DB: vehicle_is_free(): overlapping active bookings?
    P-->>A: total, per_day, reasons, available
    A-->>B: JSON (NPR)
    B->>B: update total, reasons and "save Rs X" hint
